# Demo and tests do not need credentials.
# Either use npm run connect, or set BOTH values below.
# Blank or partial overrides are rejected. Keep actual values out of Git.
# PINGROOM_TOKEN=your-robot-credential
# PINGROOM_ROOM=ROOMCODE1234
# All local paths are relative to this project:
# deck.json, config.json, .pingroom/credentials.json, .practice/state.json
